{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04314","headline":"早春洛阳荅杜审言 · 于季子","name":"早春洛阳荅杜审言","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梓泽年光往复来，杜霸游人去不回。\n若非载笔登麟阁，定是吹箫伴凤台。\n路傍桃李花犹嫩，波上芙蕖叶未开。\n分明寄语长安道，莫教留滞洛阳才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于季子","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04314.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04314","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《唐诗镜》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩鏡_(四庫全書本)）"}